---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="About Ryan Caputi | Certified Rolfer in Folsom, CA" description="Meet Ryan Caputi, Certified Rolfer in Folsom, CA with over a decade of experience in Rolfing, osteopathic manual medicine study, Craniosacral Therapy, and Somatic Experiencing.">
  <section class="px-5 py-20 md:py-28">
   <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-6xl gap-12 md:grid-cols-[.9fr_1.1fr] md:items-center">
    <img alt="Ryan Caputi portrait" class="aspect-[4/5] w-full rounded-t-full object-cover shadow-xl" src="/images/about-portrait.jpg"/>
    <div>
     <p class="text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.28em] text-[#c4924a]">
      About Ryan
     </p>
     <h1 class="mt-5 text-6xl leading-none md:text-8xl">
      A genuinely dedicated Rolfer.
     </h1>
     <div class="prose mt-8 text-xl text-[#545454]/85">
      <p>
       Hi, I’m Ryan. I’m a Certified Rolfer with over a decade of experience helping people work through chronic pain and long-standing patterns of tension, strain, and restricted movement.
      </p>
      <p>
       I’ve traveled around the country to deepen my Rolfing practice with continuing education courses in Hybrid Osteopathic-Influenced Manual Therapy Principles, Somatic Experiencing Professional Certification, NeuroAffective Touch Certification, and Levels 1 &amp; 2 of Upledger Craniosacral Therapy.
      </p>
      <p>
       My love of embodiment practices such as yoga and meditation led me to discover Rolfing. It has taken my understanding of the body to incredible heights, and I’ve dedicated myself to this craft I love.
      </p>
     </div>
     <a class="mt-9 inline-block rounded-full bg-[#c4924a] px-8 py-4 text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-white transition hover:bg-[#9b7139]" href="https://rolfing-106793.square.site">
      Book your first session
     </a>
    </div>
   </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
